 Hardware interface 10\n  -- RND.MEM GPU memory & resources 6\n  -- RND.GRAPH Render graph & GPU scheduling 9\n  -- RND.SHADER Shader system 9\n  -- RND.MAT Materials 6\n  -- RND.GEO GPU-driven geometry pipeline 7\n  -- RND.LOD Level of detail & virtualized geometry 8\n  -- RND.TEX Textures & virtual texturing 6\n  -- RND.LIGHT Direct lighting & shadows 9\n  -- RND.GI Global illumination & reflections 9\n  -- RND.RT Ray tracing infrastructure 8\n  -- RND.PT Path tracing 3\n  -- RND.RECON Reconstruction, resolution & denoising 7\n  -- RND.POST Post-processing, HDR & color 6\n  -- RND.TRANS Translucency & decals 4\n  -- RND.CHAR Character rendering 4\n  -- RND.2D 2D, vector & UI rendering 6\n  -- RND.VFX Particles & VFX 5\n== ML Machine-learning runtime\n  -- ML.RT Inference 5\n== PHY Physics & simulation\n  -- PHY.ARCH Physics architecture 7\n  -- PHY.COL Collision 8\n  -- PHY.DYN Rigid-body dynamics 6\n  -- PHY.CTRL Characters & vehicles 4\n  -- PHY.SOFT Deformables 5\n  -- PHY.DEST Destruction 4\n  -- PHY.FLUID Fluids 4\n  -- PHY.2D 2D physics 3\n== ANM Animation\n  -- ANM.ARCH Animation architecture 5\n  -- ANM.RT Animation runtime 6\n  -- ANM.DEF Skinning & deformation 5\n  -- ANM.GRAPH Animation graphs 4\n  -- ANM.SYN Motion synthesis 4\n  -- ANM.IK IK, procedural & physical animation 4\n  -- ANM.FACE Facial animation 3\n  -- ANM.CINE Cinematics 4\n== AUD Audio\n  -- AUD.ARCH Audio architecture 5\n  -- AUD.DSP DSP & mixing 7\n  -- AUD.SPAT Spatial audio & acoustics 7\n  -- AUD.CONTENT Audio content runtime 5\n== INP Input\n  -- INP.DEV Devices 8\n  -- INP.ACT Actions 8\n== NET Networking & multiplayer\n  -- NET.ARCH Network architecture 6\n  -- NET.TRANS Transport 9\n  -- NET.REP Replication 8\n  -- NET.PRED Prediction & latency hiding 6\n  -- NET.SRV Servers 5\n== GAM Gameplay, scripting, AI & persistence\n  -- GAM.FW Gameplay framework 4\n  -- GAM.SYS Gameplay systems toolkit 6\n  -- GAM.SCR Scripting 8\n  -- GAM.AI Navigation, crowds & AI 15\n  -- GAM.SAVE Persistence 7\n== UI UI, text, localization & accessibility\n  -- UI.FW UI framework 8\n  -- UI.TXT Text & fonts 6\n  -- UI.LOC Localization 7\n  -- UI.A11Y Accessibility 8\n== ED Editor & content tools\n  -- ED.ARCH Editor architecture 9\n  -- ED.UI Editor UI framework 5\n  -- ED.WORLD World editor 6\n  -- ED.GRAPH Graph editors 4\n  -- ED.COLLAB Collaboration & version control 6\n  -- ED.DEBUG Visual debugging 5\n  -- ED.AI AI-assisted authoring 3\n== BLD Build, CI/CD & release\n  -- BLD.SYS Build system 8\n  -- BLD.CI CI/CD & automation 9\n  -- BLD.REL Packaging & release 8\n== QA Testing & validation\n  -- QA.STRAT Test strategy 7\n  -- QA.RENDER Rendering validation 4\n  -- QA.FUNC Functional & stability testing 6\n  -- QA.ROBUST Robustness 4\n  -- QA.CERT Certification & compliance 7\n== PRF Performance engineering\n  -- PRF.METH Method & budgets 4\n  -- PRF.BENCH Benchmarking 5\n  -- PRF.CPU CPU performance 5\n  -- PRF.GPU GPU performance 4\n  -- PRF.LOAD Loading & hitches 4\n== OBS Observability & diagnostics\n  -- OBS.LOG Instrumentation 8\n  -- OBS.CRASH Crash & hang diagnostics 7\n== XC Cross-cutting runtime disciplines\n  -- XC.DET Determinism & replay 6\n  -- XC.ITER Hot reload & iteration 4\n  -- XC.SEC Security 11\n  -- XC.EXT Extensibility & evolution 11\n  -- XC.DX Documentation & developer experience 7","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"ed66eb92-a9a9-47a1-bef7-afb3ccb2f7c0","timestamp":"2026-09-29T15:47:02.658Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"b26764bb-822b-49b1-851e-26e7a361e5bc","userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_mobile","cwd":"/home/user/skills","sessionId":"64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"claude/engine-skill-framework-phase1"}
