.SEC.anticheat | Client anti-cheat middleware integration boundary | anti-cheat-integrity | E | \nXC.SEC.abuse | Exploit & economy-abuse detection signals | anti-cheat-integrity | E | ['platform-online-services']\nXC.EXT.api-surface | Public API surface definition | api-lifecycle-migration | E | \nXC.EXT.versioning | Semantic versioning & deprecation policy | api-lifecycle-migration | E | \nXC.EXT.abi | ABI policy for binary plugins | api-lifecycle-migration | E | ['plugin-system']\nXC.EXT.upgrade | Engine upgrade tooling (codemods, data upgraders) | api-lifecycle-migration | E | ['serialization-schema']\nXC.EXT.lts | LTS & support policy | api-lifecycle-migration | E | ['build-release-architect']\nXC.EXT.plugins | Plugin architecture & discovery | plugin-system | E | \nXC.EXT.plugin-deps | Plugin packaging & dependency resolution | plugin-system | E | \nXC.EXT.mod-sdk | Mod SDK & tooling | modding-ugc | E | \nXC.EXT.mod-loading | Mod loading & override precedence | modding-ugc | E | ['package-formats-vfs']\nXC.EXT.ugc | UGC pipeline | modding-ugc | E | ['platform-online-services']\nXC.EXT.mod-compat | Mod compatibility across patches | modding-ugc | E | ['api-lifecycle-migration']\nXC.DX.api-docs | API reference generation | developer-experience-docs | E | \nXC.DX.arch-docs | Architecture & subsystem documentation | developer-experience-docs | E | ['engine-architect']\nXC.DX.samples | Sample-project ladder (2D → open-world online) doubling as integration tests | developer-experience-docs | E | \nXC.DX.templates | Project templates & creation | developer-experience-docs | E | \nXC.DX.onboarding | Onboarding paths | developer-experience-docs | E | \nXC.DX.doc-tests | Documentation testing (snippets compile and run) | developer-experience-docs | E | ['test-architect']\nXC.DX.errors | Error-message & diagnostic quality standards | developer-experience-docs | E |","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"3bf11b74-f78f-498d-b840-ebd2991b91b0","timestamp":"2026-09-29T15:47:05.164Z","s